{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/8470c1ae08d88d750b8a766b57a527ff.avif?t=1760120213\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras_big/8470c1ae08d88d750b8a766b57a527ff.avif?t=1760120213 width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Alive&quot; </strong>isn\u2019t just a moody point-and-click adventure \u2014 it\u2019s a whole hand-crafted world inspired by Slavic mythology, full of dark humor and unforgettable characters. Every detail is drawn with care, heart, and a bit of weirdness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Vi</strong>, a 16-year-old girl looking for adventure. What she didn\u2019t expect was to find it <i>this</i> close \u2014 one bathroom break away from the car, and suddenly she\u2019s trapped in a strange village where she accidentally brings a dead girl back to life, makes friends with the local crazy grandpa, and gets a witch in serious trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What a way to start a story...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Vi manage to untangle this mess and find her way home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How did Anya die?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did the leshy get so mad at Vi?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are the witches <i>really</i> up to \u2014 and what are they hiding?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And where the hell did that talking cat come from?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the answers are waiting at the end of the road\u2026 but first, you have to take the first step. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/486634e411655d62cb6735a43450857e.avif?t=1760120213\" width=800 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf32A story-rich adventure with multiple endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your story depends on your choices. Trust the witches or stay suspicious, stay chill or raise hell, embrace the weird or run away \u2014 every decision brings you closer to one of the endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf32 Slavic mythology, reimagined</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet domovoys, banniks, witches, and other mythical beings \u2014 but don\u2019t expect the usual fairy-tale versions. Things are a bit... different here. (<i>Very</i> different.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Hand-drawn art</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A little wonky, but full of soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Puzzles with multiple solutions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing brain-melting, but you\u2019ll need to think things through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32 <strong>Unusual characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Village weirdos, mythological oddballs, mysterious witches \u2014 someone\u2019s bound to steal your heart (or your teeth). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/4ca152f399282fa42dba004325c67a4b.avif?t=1760120213\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras_big/4ca152f399282fa42dba004325c67a4b.avif?t=1760120213 width=800 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a strange and mystical world, collect items, solve puzzles, and uncover the dark secrets of the village. <br>Talk to oddball characters, make choices that shape the story, and find your own path through the adventure..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/3aaa38fa69603ee159ea63fde2eef0e2.poster.avif?t=1760120213\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/3aaa38fa69603ee159ea63fde2eef0e2.webm?t=1760120213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/3aaa38fa69603ee159ea63fde2eef0e2.mp4?t=1760120213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3625280?t=1760120213","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/6c3b81a8bd8e9fee01056d2c4f66875f705015eb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760120213","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/c312d904240745f495fed461a2e1ac6473691ff4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760120213","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/c312d904240745f495fed461a2e1ac6473691ff4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760120213","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3636330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras/8470c1ae08d88d750b8a766b57a527ff.avif?t=1760120213\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625280/extras_big/8470c1ae08d88d750b8a766b57a527ff.avif?t=1760120213 width=800 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Alive&quot; </strong>isn\u2019t just a moody point-and-click adventure \u2014 it\u2019s a whole hand-crafted